paration for Bed, Night Prayer (Isha)\n\n**Friday**\n- **6:00 AM**: Fajr Prayer\n- **7:00 AM**: Breakfast\n- **8:00 AM**: Special Friday Lecture - \"The Prophet's Life and Teachings\"\n- **11:00 AM**: Jumu'ah Prayer (All Camp Members Must Attend)\n- **12:30 PM**: Lunch\n- **2:00 PM**: Free Time\n- **4:00 PM**: Asr Prayer\n- **5:00 PM**: *Special Interaction Hour* (Earned through exemplary behavior, chosen by the Ustazah Council)\n- **7:00 PM**: Maghrib Prayer & Dinner\n- **9:00 PM**: Camp Fire Gathering - Sharing Experiences and Insights\n- **10:30 PM**: Preparation for Bed, Night Prayer (Isha)\n\n**Saturday**\n- **6:00 AM**: Fajr Prayer\n- **7:00 AM**: Breakfast\n- **8:00 AM**: Physical Training for Mindfulness\n- **10:00 AM**: Group Project - \"Designing Islamic Outreach Programs\"\n- **12:00 PM**: Dhuhr Prayer & Lunch\n- **2:00 PM**: Free Time\n- **4:00 PM**: Asr Prayer\n- **5:00 PM**: Personal Mentoring Sessions (Assigned Ustazah)\n- **7:00 PM**: Maghrib Prayer & Dinner\n- **9:00 PM**: Movie Night - \"Islamic Values in Modern Times\"\n- **10:30 PM**: Preparation for Bed, Night Prayer (Isha)\n\n**Sunday**\n- **Preparation for the Week Ahead**\n- **Review Progress, Set New Goals**\n- **Optional Meetings with Ustazah for Guidance**\n- **Prayer Times Observed as Usual**",
